  "bundle_sha256": "9ef19d91735160c537859c28bc0c355805a3868184d92518eb82fa7300cac493",
  "bundle_request_count": 19,
  "entries": [
    {
      "id": "bundle:12d433bda6673d99a39083d6fc1754c8108d0e157e70adcf46dc882543c5e7e9",
      "request_id": "12d433bda6673d99a39083d6fc1754c8108d0e157e70adcf46dc882543c5e7e9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "227c0902bf94f33385023fdfd9486522",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这是她二零一九年后第一次来亚洲，这趟也是她和丈夫的蜜月。她戴着在长隆买的帽子开发布会。双打首轮，她和曾丽美六比零、七比五赢了。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3394d66cf95785e1ff316d9740b65c8e796687854086a65ba1eb2cff44470ec7",
      "words_sha256": "458b73bf8032431e2c3b27fe830d4d9c091c51e845d6db1e8081b0292bca562e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:15bf7cef024d810e2516d204af2e222d1ecd04558f1dd08386d670d4a7fef016",
      "request_id": "15bf7cef024d810e2516d204af2e222d1ecd04558f1dd08386d670d4a7fef016",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "808001b084ab5d6be300d346928c2c27",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她拿过七个大满贯单打冠军，五个在温网；四枚奥运金牌；二零零二年登上世界第一。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fc7088b3599603d27cf84590b0b92418486c04e52525e98a0905223df61bcd51",
      "words_sha256": "f320263a923a19fe560633b336b710d3c88fb395fa2bab53d903278f821cb65c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:1a5e8cac38405f96bede48b26d0ddc254056edf511b26349f0eb04c4d4b25d61",
      "request_id": "1a5e8cac38405f96bede48b26d0ddc254056edf511b26349f0eb04c4d4b25d61",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "92b297c334d9ec538590d13df1818466",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她说：没有其他球员享受早晨，只有我。赢球很有趣，但健康最重要。我甚至不知道明年要做什么。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "74a710039e254160e80d5e84ef3aed01cab5c46e2f430e91374854cefaaa9b7b",
      "words_sha256": "cc1247ad5b3290487bf437caec941d4c43b521a2f175687b6518bc28ec65f6e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:48732855b0b8a993e0acd1abaca4ccc0b66890d7bc2c819fc0ad53b8a124533b",
      "request_id": "48732855b0b8a993e0acd1abaca4ccc0b66890d7bc2c819fc0ad53b8a124533b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e1ea42b58770a16a23f13563f0736169",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "决胜盘，她四比零领先。然后，达尼洛维奇连赢了六局。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3f95f26ec85abdfc394cd35fb48512df92edee2679ff58cd80d1d572751b0abd",
      "words_sha256": "67e8c6450dd55acb31868db08a359aab435ef97a420658e923244badae7176de"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:497ad370db03c7c6087adbd34f809fa9032cdac6ae39dd1cdc3d42b9176ff74c",
      "request_id": "497ad370db03c7c6087adbd34f809fa9032cdac6ae39dd1cdc3d42b9176ff74c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4d17c3e2e09c3070b33c8dbc10aed431",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "单打首轮的对手是四号种子塔格尔，十八岁，比她小二十八岁。一小时十二分钟，二比六、二比六，第十六场连败。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "85cc8ada987d872c475dea4f075930a85c560e080021fe44cf38fbd695e4f344",
      "words_sha256": "fe3d1722af9e3dc6ed4fe0feed2faafad580872cae478ee725c97256036c7069"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4ab8d9af8dd20285ad4606cc4bd895e75ba451bb3e36ac3d22016a2932b7d6eb",
      "request_id": "4ab8d9af8dd20285ad4606cc4bd895e75ba451bb3e36ac3d22016a2932b7d6eb",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "45bde0147d4e73feb04775f4fd9e8569",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "可那场之后，她的单打再没赢过：二零二五年输了三场，二零二六年到美网为止又输了十二场。有两场，只差一点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2e20ef617274cb125e2006c7b0104c4c215dfa03052523c483aa1b38c2a822ca",
      "words_sha256": "a9eb4cd3a26536f7563f086f1b9649882680a9ce24fa76fb24fa77b45d695e32"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:57d63f5ee5e6c8bfd009021e9e1e0a6360c5b7fde9c59139844d33422aa7582c",
      "request_id": "57d63f5ee5e6c8bfd009021e9e1e0a6360c5b7fde9c59139844d33422aa7582c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f3d9ac7c05eb3dea110660cdd44553ed",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "46岁，16连败，为什么还在打？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "341accc0f2b581761bf2fc872904a9d981dd8a1eb02e12a59ad7e6586108f646",
      "words_sha256": "013d4544c1dbd19d1a151f5a3eb1a958488b6c0e4341e32af2ccf9d6ec061653"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:586c097e58afe1f1200bc876288073cfdcb11e96f9ebfbea7c0e0735323f2358",
      "request_id": "586c097e58afe1f1200bc876288073cfdcb11e96f9ebfbea7c0e0735323f2358",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d16b94763552b0cbcf049f7c643bfdfe",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一年多里，美网、澳网、美网，她都是拿外卡进的正赛；今年的印第安维尔斯、迈阿密、马德里和辛辛那提，也是外卡。有人说该把机会留给年轻人，也有人说，球迷就是来看传奇的。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "56657e6549a4a08bc26b3acfe68d53fe14c02b7ae45aec9a7d772bef7a23283a",
      "words_sha256": "172831702d5d01a37c528723ddca67fb1a31b1933b6160e9b0f3e1daed2c2142"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:58c293150bec8d3a106800d177326d43c65abdd0973728f4f571152b45ca7b9e",
      "request_id": "58c293150bec8d3a106800d177326d43c65abdd0973728f4f571152b45ca7b9e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "2836f2748925bd3087e0ddb5d871c099",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一月澳网，四十五岁的她是正赛年纪最大的女选手。首轮对达尼洛维奇，她打进了决胜盘。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a52b7d43971f7244b15b3db87383735a47740b7380980d740ce58c966726daf0",
      "words_sha256": "1863d90b9d460787af5b3f36138cdb2784a7af7cd047b031dd7f9d99edd6f99c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6d7aee946327e4f3c24e9e99c76968aea974cc6f4e81f370260dd329cd664e0c",
      "request_id": "6d7aee946327e4f3c24e9e99c76968aea974cc6f4e81f370260dd329cd664e0c",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a00c9c4520921ae20e86ebb48a61c6b8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "赛前有记者问：四十五岁了，天这么热，为什么还要打？她笑着反问：为什么不呢？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "a0805f67e000f34a62257877e54475a8c5d5c6d6a147c900f3619968d09fb405",
      "words_sha256": "463f5a6fa1eb4d8ed5d2f0de1a5f8c2c828d9f6fdfacc8b7227619518b6626a2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:70630f1943bea421ee5c9fced36c57dd532061975b51c0839284a06741fa2055",
      "request_id": "70630f1943bea421ee5c9fced36c57dd532061975b51c0839284a06741fa2055",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "bdd15510905f91a8a1da0a31426f3280",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "八月美网首轮，对手是肯宁。第二盘她七次拿到盘点，抢七里六比二领先，又连丢了六分。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "df4d7c7da2f02f095e2d2045b0b50f9a67132705b3369e35db67050fa479d243",
      "words_sha256": "115b43674a14738f5eb64cab2f944702bf8dcb206a19aaa8e459bc55714155a4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8ac99a9dc64b6f9de33afe525c2b46604df4cf92103b19e19e63543871ea34b9",
      "request_id": "8ac99a9dc64b6f9de33afe525c2b46604df4cf92103b19e19e63543871ea34b9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "26eac26abc71487c364fe2744c3ebe8b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "她说，想念的是比赛本身的乐趣和挑战。很多时候，要战胜的是你自己。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "8ab1a356d43cd3c1fae7db8ea04dc7326e98452e09939d26ba0ee5fbb99ad092",
      "words_sha256": "5ad91e43cdd135db3aeb823af0458c77901826ea5ca7613bde864bf19e84ce91"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:99c40b994a8ddc4ed8d384fda41e92bfd086d7b79bf03c3b139c92ddeffa52f9",
      "request_id": "99c40b994a8ddc4ed8d384fda41e92bfd086d7b79bf03c3b139c92ddeffa52f9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "5e04165691f6e20d759c50c9282e4e77",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六比二，打成了六比八。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "50925f284005e344031f80df2ad610769b553a5820af9043b6d1e04c0ce3f2ca",
      "words_sha256": "71eae981c9a7a52a0d7357f40251cfc4a3f1490432bdd863ec576eeed5b914d2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b2e7a29c9d116ad9959540c58512bacf55bf088e7d8eb68adac11a42f1df2f6b",
      "request_id": "b2e7a29c9d116ad9959540c58512bacf55bf088e7d8eb68adac11a42f1df2f6b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "37b1c0353ade25b4b4f6aa7d5121f9e9",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "二零二四年三月之后，她做了子宫肌瘤手术，离开赛场十六个月。二零二五年夏天，她在华盛顿复出。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ef83ace7158b47b40c3cb263d4c11b42c9651bf9150ecb48fbcf817c409ceb27",
      "words_sha256": "6e1219308247fbb560eafc71a6e82a245afeed55b3bf3bd7ff5cb78e73706b8e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "7bc2ef3d70d538dcd250d7b2d55a6f09f218dce01671ae9f9d943c295f5a8be4",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:c1a9a8502bcc324a1b1e7bee04b31f7875f0f259cbfd890e63dea290ddd2f9fa",
      "request_id": "c1a9a8502bcc324a1b1e7bee04b31f7875f0f259cbfd890e63dea290ddd2f9fa",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "6dad889d709598c39fb25041a97bf371",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四十六岁的大威廉姆斯，单打已经连输十五场。她又拿着外卡来到广州，为什么还在打？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f233616e3f5979071e3432ad46b811b89eec326d1a23c5968fc2e18fcefac9a2",
      "words_sha256": "26fa9cc8dfaf900701ad248c562c440b525aa6430939c5071a539a4d0847717e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:d50b38d3596a2a06f5f3dd23700fe26d0770e8d34930cd9e8c9c124e61e67e14",
      "request_id": "d50b38d3596a2a06f5f3dd23700fe26d0770e8d34930cd9e8c9c124e61e67e14",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "efbb46b3b2666df8ceab6e9c0dbae79a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "美网输球后，被问到未来的打算，她说：我不觉得我必须去想这个。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "12bc86e95fa07b90aa90768f5381becc6199e239f15b120ab977a61aa1014434",
      "words_sha256": "cde4e84032ed276cdc12daae9d0a13a8a228e522fbea24fd733dae2d3b53e596"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e337c324087a1f4c88fcfff4a78cfd4ab34d191c6c00cbce03e850a49fff8d4a",
      "request_id": "e337c324087a1f4c88fcfff4a78cfd4ab34d191c6c00cbce03e850a49fff8d4a",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "db3370b34fcfda7438ee0dcd299341c3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一年，小威也回来陪她打双打。辛辛那提和美网，两场都输在抢十；美网那场，抢十里她们五比零领先。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "f6df71521f0bf816104ec5a6ff4b7ae432a3d762e16d92c69fa0b6bf264ae9b0",
      "words_sha256": "d48eaf04c9c06cdf4b7deb7ede65ca0dca64e884af24150c99efbf2516850654"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:fdaa017a5469899be2423936512dbef506d3c15e02eaea4d4caeae14e3941497",
      "request_id": "fdaa017a5469899be2423936512dbef506d3c15e02eaea4d4caeae14e3941497",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "b52460447850a11cc5ef2e62e2eef6c8",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四十六岁，还在输，也还在打。你觉得，她该把外卡让给年轻人吗？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "2f0ca3603aa7214bf2a323c3c52a2f5f44d6f2cff9cbeee37fcabebc05bfe1bf",
      "words_sha256": "a760be184498ef847210c252d156bccd07431d30728ec16f9798df0cb43ddccf"
    },
